===Adjective===
{{en-adj|flimsier|flimsiest|more}}

# Likely to [[bend]] or [[break]] under [[pressure]]; [[weak]], [[shaky]], [[flexible]], or [[fragile]].
#: ''
i. The likeness of those who take Auliyâ' (protectors and helpers) other than Allâh is as the likeness of a spider, who builds (for itself) a house, but verily, the '''flimsiest''' (weakest) of houses is the spider's house; if they but knew. (Surah Al-Ankabut:41)

ii. He expected the '''flimsy''' structure to collapse at any moment.''

